# Complex projects

Switch to `spec-skills-lib/flows/complex-flow.yaml` when complexity signals apply (see `rules/complexity-profile.yaml`).

When `complexity_profile: high`, produce WBS and epics under `docs/requirements/` before architecture.

Run the `infrastructure` role before parallel frontend/backend work.
